      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "We are deeply saddened to share the tragic loss of Air Interdiction Agent Robert (Bob) Cox, who passed away in an off-duty aircraft incident on April 9. Bob’s life was defined by service—from his early days in the U.S. Army, through his distinguished Marine Corps career as a Cobra pilot, to his dedicated work with Air and Marine Operations. He was a true professional, a devoted family man, and an avid outdoorsman.\n \nOur hearts go out to his family, friends, and colleagues as we honor his memory and legacy. Please keep them in your thoughts during this difficult time.\n \nRest in peace, Bob. Your service and friendship will never be forgotten.",
      "text_resolved": "We are deeply saddened to share the tragic loss of Air Interdiction Agent Robert (Bob) Cox, who passed away in an off-duty aircraft incident on April 9. Bob’s life was defined by service—from his early days in the U.S. Army, through his distinguished Marine Corps career as a Cobra pilot, to his dedicated work with Air and Marine Operations. He was a true professional, a devoted family man, and an avid outdoorsman.\n \nOur hearts go out to his family, friends, and colleagues as we honor his memory and legacy. Please keep them in your thoughts during this difficult time.\n \nRest in peace, Bob. Your service and friendship will never be forgotten.",
