      "quoted_tweet_id": null,
      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "🚨San Diego Air and Marine Branch Apprehends 13 Illegal Aliens off the coast of California🚨\n \nOn April 17, San Diego Air and Marine Branch detected a Target of Interest 5nm south of the Maritime Boundary Line headed toward San Clemente Island. Marine Interdiction Agents aboard Coastal Interceptor Vessels responded and swiftly interdicted the Target of Interest without incident. Thirteen illegal aliens—7 adult males, 5 adult females, and 1 accompanied juvenile female—were apprehended. Migrants and vessel were transported to Ballast Point Naval Base for processing. AMO remains vigilant and will not tolerate unlawful entry attempts. #BorderSecurity",
